        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-202" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Record its mac address and update the nvs field paired&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2290" y="2768.75" width="160" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-203" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Unpair mode&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2620" y="2478.75" width="80" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-204" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;LED reminder not paired&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2590" y="2518.75" width="140" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-205" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Reconfigure and go to sleep&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2605" y="2558.75" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-206" value="1. Power-on/wake-up initialization work&lt;div&gt;Print device/debug information&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Hardware initialization - GPIO, Lora air wake-up mode (can be optimized according to lora configuration characteristics, setting it here every time may delay time, such as setting it after each pair)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Check if paired&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3060" y="1995" width="440" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-207" value="2. Identify the current mode based on button identification and sleep/wakeup reasons&lt;div&gt;lora module wake-up - normal mode&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;user button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Long press (3s) Pair mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;dev button&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Short press test mode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Long press config mode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Unpair unpaired mode&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3060" y="2035" width="410" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-208" value="3. Corresponding mode processing&lt;div&gt;Unpair mode - send reminder and go to sleep&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Nomral normal mode - enter sleep waiting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Pair pairing mode, the modules inside and outside the car are paired and the communication mac address is recorded&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Test test mode, used for development and factory testing of hardware&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Config configuration mode, reserved for future use on demand, can be used for new versions/temporary modification of device configurations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Read its own battery level - low battery LED alarm, extremely low battery LED alarm and stop working&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3060" y="2175" width="430" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-209" value="Car rear radar module program design" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3020" y="1955" width="190" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-210" value="4. Configure deep sleep and wake up, then enter sleep" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3060" y="2300" width="220" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-211" value="Unpair mode&lt;div&gt;Remind through LED breathing light and enter sleep after 5 seconds&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3067" y="2355" width="273" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-212" value="Test mode&lt;div&gt;To be added&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3067" y="2655" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-213" value="Config mode&lt;div&gt;To be added&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3031" y="2695" width="140" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-214" value="Pair pairing mode&lt;div&gt;Initialize espnow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Send pairing requests in a loop&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;After receiving the reply from the radar module, record its mac address and update the nvs field paired&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pairing successful&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Enter sleep and wait to wake up&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3070" y="2525" width="400" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-215" value="Normal mode&lt;div&gt;Initialize the radar sensor and try reading multiple times to determine whether the radar is working properly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Initialize espnow hardware&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Control the lora module to send ack data packets (sent three times)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Continue to read radar sensor data regularly and send it to the in-car module through espnow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;If no ack feedback is obtained from the in-car module for more than 3 seconds, it will stop working and go to sleep.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3067" y="2385" width="441" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-216" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;lora sends 3 acks, including battery power status&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1994" y="2528.75" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-218" value="open point" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="943" y="1330" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-219" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Configure deep sleep and wake up, then enter sleep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="962" y="3280" width="232" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-220" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Configure deep sleep and wake up, then enter sleep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2329" y="2951.25" width="232" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-221" value="&lt;b&gt;Low battery: two levels, for example, if it is lower than 3.4v, it will start to remind you, if it is lower than 3.2, it will stop working.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Low battery only alarms to remind you to charge. Extremely low battery alarms also stop working, because the ranging data is no longer reliable at this time.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="936" y="1450" width="310" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-223" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Read own battery level - low battery alarm&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1023" y="2338" width="125" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-226" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Check radar module power - low -&amp;gt; Alarm once, extremely low -&amp;gt; Alarm and stop working&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="612.5" y="2843" width="171" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-227" value="&lt;b&gt;During low battery periods, if you consider trying your best to ensure the last reversing operation, you can try to replace espnow with lora communication, which should consume less power.&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="934" y="1520" width="310" height="80" as="geometry" />
