        <mxCell id="7CyqZpYL4BO0aw3nbGov-228" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;(Not repeated with the one after ack) Check the radar module power - low -&amp;gt; Alarm once, extremely low -&amp;gt; Alarm and stop working&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="613.5" y="3150" width="171" height="40" as="geometry" />
